{"3133930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exo Mayhem: A Supervillain Experience", "steam_appid": 3133930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stuck in a time loop, with chaos and mythology:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a Supervillain, trapped in mythology against a time loop. Fly with a super suit across fractured open-worlds, fight with tech based superpowers and weapons against robots, time remnants of people, and zombies and monsters in hell, upgrade your super suit, and unleash chaos with destructible environments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Break the  loop or stay and fight, you are the most powerful being in this place. just be careful in hell, the leviathan is there…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who doesn’t love destruction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy walkways, blast through walls, shatter glass, and shoot down birds from the sky, or fly with them, that one is up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story and sandbox gameplay:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the loop by helping shady people around the map; they pay you, and you get free from the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight through time and hell itself:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between mythic dimensions of chaos, earth has become fractured in time and space and travel to hell to fight zombie demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your powers and guns:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you break the loop, purchase new gear and styles to become stronger each and every day you play.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stuck in a time loop, with chaos and mythology:</strong></h2><p class